    "Background location lets the app notice meaningful city changes. You can pause sharing at any time." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "后台位置让 App 能发现重要的城市变化。你随时都可以暂停共享。" } } } },
