    "Step %lld of %lld" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "第 %1$lld 步，共 %2$lld 步" } } } },
    "Stops sharing both ways" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "双向停止共享" } } } },
    "Stored precision" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "存储精度" } } } },
    "The app requests coarse, city-level use. iOS controls when background Visits and significant changes arrive." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "App 只使用城市级粗略位置。后台到访与重要位置变化的触发时机由 iOS 控制。" } } } },
    "The friendship and per-friend sharing preferences will be removed." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "好友关系和针对该朋友的共享偏好将被移除。" } } } },
    "The local demo schedules a real local notification. Production will create the same idempotent event on the server and deliver it through APNs." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "本地演示会安排真实的本地通知。生产环境会在服务器创建同样可去重的事件，并通过 APNs 发送。" } } } },
    "The server will delete your account, friendships, preferences and current city presence." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "服务器将删除你的账号、好友关系、偏好和当前城市状态。" } } } },
    "This location is too old for same-city alerts" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "此位置过旧，无法用于同城提醒" } } } },
